<title>UK: Essen Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark five-year Pfandbrief.</title>
<headline>Essen Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark five-year Pfandbrief.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate Pfandbrief issue was announced by joint lead managers Commerzbank and Lehman Brothers Bankhaus.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HYPOTHEKENBANK IN ESSEN AG</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    09.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE    22.OCT.96</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  100.20    FULL FEES   0.20</p>
<p> LISTING   DUSSELDORF DENOMS (K) 1</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.10</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
